      "amount": "2 tbsp"
    },
    {
      "name": "balsamic vinegar",
      "amount": "1 tbsp"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 350°F (175°C).",
    "Slice the apples and place them in a baking dish.",
    "Mix together dijon mustard, fresh herbs, custard, olive oil, and balsamic vinegar. Pour over the apples and mix evenly.",
    "Bake for about 20-25 minutes or until the apples are soft but still have some texture.",
    "Let it cool a bit before serving."
